  "releaseNotes": "WebhookRelayMessageProcessor now awaits every OnWebhookNotification handler before completing the Service Bus message. If a handler throws, including after an await, the message is redelivered and eventually dead-lettered instead of being silently completed. Handlers must finish within the message lock window, which is auto-renewed for up to 2 minutes. There are no API changes.",
